---
import InformationPage from "../components/InformationPage.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_ROUTES } from "../data/site";
import "../styles/information.css";

const contactHref = `mailto:${SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL}`;
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy | FundraisingDirectory.net"
  description="How FundraisingDirectory.net handles information: the Get Listed form, email, optional analytics, and your choices."
>
  <InformationPage
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    breadcrumbLabel="Privacy"
    title="How this site handles your information."
    intro="Effective November 20, 2026. This page describes what FundraisingDirectory.net collects, why, and the choices you have."
  >
    <section>
      <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          The site has no user accounts, payment processing, newsletters, or
          advertising technology.
          The Fundraiser Finder runs in your browser and does not create a saved
          user profile. Shareable Finder URLs can contain your choices, as
          explained below.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Get Listed form for fundraising providers</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          The <a href={SITE_ROUTES.forProviders}>For Providers</a> form asks for
          your organization or provider name and website, your fundraising
          programs and the groups they serve, anything else you choose to share,
          your contact name and work email, and, optionally, your role or title
          and phone number.
        </p>
        <p>
          The form does not send anything to our servers. When you choose{" "}
          <strong>Submit for Review</strong>, it opens your own email app with
          your answers in a message addressed to {SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL}. Nothing is
          sent until you send that email yourself.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use what you send only to review your listing request, contact you
          about it, and keep your listing accurate. Submitting does not create or
          publish a listing automatically. Organization details may appear on a
          public listing if one is published. Submitting the form does not
          automatically publish your contact details.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          If you email <a href={contactHref}>{SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, we use your
          message and address only to reply and handle your request.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          We have not established a fixed retention period for listing requests
          and other correspondence. Email services may also retain copies or
          backups. Contact us to ask about retention or request deletion of
          information you sent us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          To see, correct, or delete information you sent us, email{" "}
          <a href={contactHref}>{SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Optional audience measurement</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          The site includes a consent-gated Google Analytics 4 integration that is
          inactive unless you choose <strong>Accept analytics</strong>. Before that
          choice, the site does not request the Google Analytics script or send
          analytics events. If enabled with consent, the site may
          measure page use and general interactions such as provider searches,
          directory filters, Finder completion, and outbound provider-link clicks.
        </p>
        <p>
          The site's custom interaction events do not attach provider search
          words, Finder answers, form text, or provider ranking and
          commercial-affiliation data as event parameters. Google and hosting
          infrastructure may still process technical data
          such as IP address, browser information, page URL, and request time under
          their respective terms. Your choice is stored in your browser so it
          persists across visits. You can use <strong>Cookie preferences</strong>{" "}
          in the footer at any time to change it. Withdrawing consent disables
          future analytics events and removes accessible first-party Google
          Analytics cookies set by this site.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical request data</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          Cloudflare provides the site's hosting infrastructure. As with most
          websites, hosting and security infrastructure may process
          technical request information needed to deliver and protect the site,
          such as an IP address, browser details, requested URL, and request time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Links to provider websites</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          Provider pages link to independent third-party websites. Their privacy
          practices and transactions are governed by their own policies, not this
          page. Review a provider's terms before submitting information or making a
          payment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Information kept in your browser</h2>
      <div><p>Finder choices appear in the page URL so you can share a shortlist.
        The provider comparison keeps selected provider IDs in this tab's session
        storage and in shareable URLs. These features do not create an account.
        Requested page URLs reach our host and, if analytics is enabled, may be
        processed by Google. This can include Finder choices or search terms in
        shared URLs. Avoid putting sensitive information in URLs.</p>
        <p>Your email app and the service receiving our mailbox process messages
        you choose to send. Their storage and backup practices also apply; no
        message is sent by the Get Listed form automatically.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          This site is intended for adults organizing fundraisers and provider
          representatives. Please avoid sending personal information about children.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          We update this page, and its effective date, before adding any feature
          that collects new information.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </InformationPage>
</SiteLayout>
